BeStMeta schema — LicenseRef-BeStMeta-Unresolved

This identifier records an unresolved upstream licensing discrepancy; it is
not a new licence grant. The pinned repository LICENSE and README describe
MIT licensing for schema/code, while bestmeta_schema.yaml declares CC-BY-4.0
in its header and licence field. Both notices and attribution are preserved.
Obtain upstream clarification before asserting unqualified redistribution
terms or publishing a release with a blanket MIT claim.

